{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frost Loop is a city building survival game set on a train in the snow.\u00a0 </strong>Inspired by FrostPunk and SnowPiercer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a train car, a few people, meager resources, and must build up to the ultimate train to bring humanity through the frozen apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967750/extras/578ee8e188903b618bbe41e64511d206.poster.avif?t=1774628757\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967750/extras/578ee8e188903b618bbe41e64511d206.webm?t=1774628757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967750/extras/578ee8e188903b618bbe41e64511d206.mp4?t=1774628757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your train one car at a time.\u00a0 Each train car generates its own resource and can be destroyed.\u00a0 You can only build so many train cars, so which will you build to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967750/extras/2628ccdac60c128ae13974a6ea6be721.poster.avif?t=1774628757\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967750/extras/2628ccdac60c128ae13974a6ea6be721.webm?t=1774628757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967750/extras/2628ccdac60c128ae13974a6ea6be721.mp4?t=1774628757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your people and resources.\u00a0 Will you have what you need to keep the train rolling?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pilot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967750/extras/108ab19371ba27e76847500f35411593.poster.avif?t=1774628757\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967750/extras/108ab19371ba27e76847500f35411593.webm?t=1774628757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967750/extras/108ab19371ba27e76847500f35411593.mp4?t=1774628757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your train around the map to avoid the always moving storms and to uncover key locations.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Departure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967750/9971c1b158e39730cfee67da8aa47e093a53a3cb.jpg"},{"name":"Evicted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967750/7273f60c8f1fb7d1c03dca1ad704a7de1040d208.jpg"},{"name":"Hopeful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967750/fb21b6dc5b8bc441871f250665db60f3110b1cec.jpg"},{"name":"Greenland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967750/085e2d5c31562918d0e578f625b890f5bc8b22bd.jpg"},{"name":"Entry Level Conductor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967750/d831184cdaa639022ec083b68d724fb1991e387b.jpg"},{"name":"Junior Level Conductor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967750/a12a4d560cf55acbc